= ui_card "Toggle Panel Helper"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_toggle_panel(title, position: :left, &block)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Progressive disclosure is key to simple interfaces. The <code>ui_toggle_panel</code> helper uses native web standards to hide complexity until needed.
  ul
    li <strong>Native:</strong> Uses <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> for free accessibility.
    li <strong>Clean:</strong> Removes the need for complex JavaScript accordions.

  h3 Arguments
  = ui_table ["Name", "Type", "Description"],
    [["title", "String/HTML", "The text or HTML to display in the summary line."],
     ["block", "Block", "The hidden content."]]

  h3 Real World Scenarios

  h4 1. Advanced Settings
  p Hide advanced options to keep the UI clean.

  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      = ui_toggle_panel "Advanced Settings" do
        p API Key: *****
        p Region: US-East-1

      = ui_code do
        | = ui_toggle_panel "Advanced Settings" do
            ...content...
